cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use verified-reserving, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "verified-reserving: machine-checked claims reserving in Lean 4"
authors:
  - family-names: Sneiderman
    given-names: Robert
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/Robby955/verified-reserving"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robby955/verified-reserving"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of Mack's distribution-free chain-ladder model for
  claims reserving: the chain-ladder estimators and Mack's mean squared error
  of prediction as definitions, the deterministic identities behind them, the
  equality of Mack's 1999 recursive form with the 1993 closed form, and the
  conditional unbiasedness of the development factor under Mack's first
  assumption, proved with mathlib's conditional expectation.
